{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39897","headline":"骄侈 · 徐夤","name":"骄侈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"骄侈阽危俭素牢，镜中形影岂能逃。\n石家恃富身还灭，颜子非贫道不遭。\n蝙蝠亦能知日月，鸾凤那肯啄腥臊。\n古今人事惟堪醉，好脱霜裘换绿醪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39897.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39897","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}